## Scoring Guide

| Dimension | 1-2 | 3-4 | 5 |
|-----------|-----|-----|---|
| Market Size | Under $10M | $10M-$100M | Over $100M |
| Competition | Red ocean 10+ | Moderate 3-10 | Blue ocean under 3 |
| Barriers | High (capital/regulatory) | Medium | Low (technical only) |
| Monetization | Unclear path | Possible | Obvious model |
| Personal Fit | No relevant skills | Some skills | Perfect match |

## Decision Bands

| Score | Decision |
|-------|---------|
| 20-25 | Strong proceed |
| 15-19 | Proceed with caution |
| 10-14 | Needs pivot |
| <10 | Pass |

## Notes

- Any score >= 4 on Market Size or Competition requires a cited source URL or flag as "missing_data"
- If Personal Fit < 3, reject regardless of total score
- Score ideas in batches of 10+ for meaningful comparison
